#: model:ir.model.fields,help:spp_cel_domain.field_spp_data_value__params_hash
msgid ""
"SHA256 hash (truncated to 16 chars) of additional parameters used in value "
"computation. Used to distinguish cached values computed with different "
"parameter sets.\n"
"\n"
"Example use cases:\n"
"- Scoring model computed with threshold=100 vs threshold=200\n"
"- External API query with filter={'status': 'active'}\n"
"- Aggregate computed over different member subsets\n"
"\n"
"Empty string when no parameters were used (most common case)."
msgstr ""
"Empreinte SHA256 (tronquée à 16 caractères) des paramètres supplémentaires "
"utilisés dans le calcul de la valeur. Utilisée pour distinguer les valeurs "
